o-one {\n    top: 181px;\n    width: 318px;\n  }\n\n  .intro-two {\n    top: 241px;\n    width: 320px;\n  }\n\n  .definition {\n    top: 320px;\n  }\n\n  .notation {\n    top: 360px;\n  }\n\n  .classification {\n    top: 400px;\n  }\n\n  .classification-last {\n    top: 420px;\n  }\n\n  .placeholder {\n    position: absolute;\n  }\n\n  .visually-hidden {\n    position: absolute;\n    width: 1px;\n    height: 1px;\n    margin: -1px;\n    padding: 0;\n    overflow: hidden;\n    clip: rect(0 0 0 0);\n    white-space: nowrap;\n    border: 0;\n  }\n\n  .main-diagram {\n    top: 201px;\n    left: 373px;\n    width: 124px;\n    height: 105px;\n  }\n\n  .diagram-set {\n    top: 440px;\n    left: 102px;\n    width: 352px;\n    height: 99px;\n  }\n\n  svg {\n    display: block;\n    width: 100%;\n    height: 100%;\n    overflow: visible;\n  }\n\n  .diagram-line {\n    fill: none;\n    stroke: #777;\n    stroke-width: 1.15;\n    stroke-linecap: round;\n    stroke-linejoin: round;\n  }\n\n  .diagram-text {\n    fill: #666;\n    font-family: \"Times New Roman\", \"SimSun\", serif;\n    font-size: 9px;\n    font-style: italic;\n  }\n\n  .diagram-caption {\n    fill: #777;\n    font-family: \"SimSun\", \"Songti SC\", serif;\n    font-size: 9px;\n    font-style: normal;\n    letter-spacing: .4px;\n  }\n\n  .thought-box {\n    position: absolute;\n    top: 550px;\n    left: 44px;\n    width: 472px;\n    height: 104px;\n    padding: 12px 16px 8px 29px;\n    background:\n      radial-gradient(circle at 80% 35%, rgba(255,255,255,.75), transparent 45%),\n      linear-gradient(100deg, #eef9fa, #f7fbfb);\n  }\n\n  .thought-icon {\n    position: absolute;\n    top: 6px;\n    left: 12px;\n    width: 29px;\n    height: 29px;\n    border-radius: 50%;\n    background: #4aa0c5;\n  }\n\n  .thought-icon::before,\n  .thought-icon::after {\n    content: \"\";\n    position: absolute;\n    left: 13px;\n    top: 2px;\n    width: 4px;\n    height: 25px;\n    border-radius: 3px;\n    background: rgba(255,255,255,.85);\n    transform-origin: center;\n  }\n\n  .thought-icon::before {\n    transform: rotate(42deg);\n  }\n\n  .thought-icon::after {\n    transform: rotate(-42deg);\n  }\n\n  .thought-heading {\n    position: absolute;\n    top: 13px;\n    left: 49px;\n    margin: 0;\n    font-family: \"Microsoft YaHei\", \"PingFang SC\", sans-serif;\n    font-size: 13px;\n    line-height: 18px;\n    font-weight: 700;\n    color: #59666a;\n  }\n\n  .thought-text {\n    position: absolute;\n    top: 39px;\n    left: 29px;\n    right: 13px;\n    margin: 0;\n    text-indent: 2em;\n    font-size: 12.5px;\n    line-height: 20px;\n    color: #7a8588;\n  }\n\n  .answer {\n    position: absolute;\n    top: 662px;\n    left: 44px;\n    width: 472px;\n    margin: 0;\n    text-indent: 2em;\n    font-size: 13px;\n    line-height: 20px;\n    letter-spacing: .1px;\n    color: #707070;\n  }\n\n  .footer {\n    position: absolute;\n    left: 44px;\n    bottom: 33px;\n    display: flex;\n    align-items: baseline;\n    gap: 17px;\n    font-size: 11px;\n    line-height: 15px;\n    color: #737373;\n  }\n\n  .page-number {\n    font-family: Arial, sans-serif;\n  }\n\n  @media (max-width: 540px) {\n    body {\n      justify-content: flex-start;\n    }\n\n    .page {\n      transform-origin: top left;\n    }\n  }\n</style>\n</head>\n<body>\n<main class=\"page\">\n  <h1 class=\"chapter-title\">11.1&nbsp;&nbsp;与三角形有关的线段</h1>\n\n  <div class=\"watermark\">@🌚港城宝藏女孩😊</div>\n\n  <h2 class=\"section-title\">11.1.1　三角形的边</h2>\n\n  <div class=\"text intro-one\">\n    <p class=\"paragraph\">在本章引言中，我们提到许多三角形的实际例子<br>\n    由不在同一条直线上的三条线段首尾顺次相<br>\n    接所组成的图形叫做三角形（triangle）。</p>\n  </div>\n\n  <div class=\"text intro-two\">\n    <p class=\"paragraph\">在图 11.1-1 中，线段 AB、BC、CA 是三角<br>\n    形的边，点 A、B、C 是三角形的顶点，∠A、<br>\n    ∠B、∠C 是相邻两边组成的角，叫做三角形的内<br>\n    角，简称三角形的角。</p>\n  </div>\n\n  <figure class=\"placeholder main-diagram\" aria-label=\"图11.1-1 三角形ABC\">\n    <span class=\"visually-hidden\">[Diagram: upper-right]</span>\n    <svg viewBox=\"0 0 124 105\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"三角形ABC，三边分别标为a、b、c\">\n      <path class=\"diagram-line\" d=\"M76 8 L24 65 L111 65 Z\"/>\n      <text class=\"diagram-text\" x=\"76\" y=\"7\">A</text>\n      <text class=\"diagram-text\" x=\"17\" y=\"69\">B</text>\n      <text class=\"diagram-text\" x=\"113\" y=\"69\">C</text>\n      <text class=\"diagram-text\" x=\"64\" y=\"80\">a</text>\n      <text class=\"diagram-text\" x=\"95\" y=\"39\">b</text>\n      <text class=\"diagram-text\" x=\"43\" y=\"39\">c</text>\n      <text class=\"diagram-caption\" x=\"60\" y=\"94\">图 11.1-1</text>\n    </svg>\n  </figure>\n\n  <div class=\"text definition\">\n    <p class=\"paragraph\">顶点是 A、B、C 的三角形，记作△ABC，读作“三角形 ABC”。</p>\n  </div>\n\n  <div class=\"text notation\">\n    <p class=\"paragraph\">△ABC 的三边，有时也用 a，b，c 来表示。如图 11.1-1，顶点 A 所对的边 BC<br>\n    用 a 表示，顶点 B 所对的边 AC 用 b 表示，顶点 C 所对的边 AB 用 c 表示。</p>\n  </div>\n\n  <div class=\"text classification\">\n    <p class=\"paragraph\">我们知道：三边都相等的三角形叫做等边三角形（图 11.1-2（1））；有<br>\n    两条边相等的三角形叫做等腰三角形（图 11.1-2（2））。</p>\n  </div>\n\n  <div class=\"text classification-last\">\n    <p class=\"paragraph\">图 11.1-2（3）中的三角形是三边都不相等的三角形。</p>\n  </div>\n\n  <figure class=\"placeholder diagram-set\" aria-label=\"图11.1-2 三种三角形\">\n    <span class=\"visually-hidden\">[Diagram: three triangles centered]</span>\n    <svg viewBox=\"0 0 352 99\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"三个分别标为1、2、3的三角形\">\n      <path class=\"diagram-line\" d=\"M64 5 L28 67 L101 67 Z\"/>\n      <text class=\"diagram-text\" x=\"62\" y=\"7\">A</text>\n      <text class=\"diagram-text\" x=\"20\" y=\"70\">B</text>\n      <text class=\"diagram-text\" x=\"103\" y=\"70\">C</text>\n      <text class=\"diagram-caption\" x=\"56\" y=\"84\">（1）</text>\n\n      <path class=\"diagram-line\" d=\"M173 19 L132 67 L215 67 Z\"/>\n      <text class=\"diagram-text\" x=\"171\" y=\"20\">A</text>\n      <text class=\"diagram-text\" x=\"124\" y=\"70\">B</text>\n      <text class=\"diagram-text\" x=\"217\" y=\"70\">C</text>\n      <text class=\"diagram-caption\" x=\"165\" y=\"84\">（2）</text>\n\n      <path class=\"diagram-line\" d=\"M307 20 L248 67 L333 67 Z\"/>\n      <text class=\"diagram-text\" x=\"305\" y=\"21\">A</text>\n      <text class=\"diagram-text\" x=\"240\" y=\"70\">B</text>\n      <text class=\"diagram-text\" x=\"335\" y=\"70\">C</text>\n      <text class=\"diagram-caption\" x=\"299\" y=\"84\">（3）</text>\n\n      <text class=\"diagram-caption\" x=\"158\" y=\"97\">图 11.1-2</text>\n    </svg>\n  </figure>\n\n  <section class=\"thought-box\">\n    <div class=\"thought-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></div>\n    <h3 class=\"thought-heading\">思考</h3>\n    <p class=\"thought-text\">我们知道，按照三个内角的大小，可以将三角形分为锐角三角形、直<br>\n    角三角形和钝角三角形。如何按照边的关系对三角形进行分类呢？说说你<br>\n    的想法，并与同学交流。</p>\n  </section>\n\n  <p class=\"answer\">以“是否有边相等”，可以将三角形分为两类：三边都不相等的三角形和<br>\n  等腰三角形。</p>\n\n  <footer class=\"footer\">\n    <span class=\"page-number\">2</span>\n    <span>第十一章　三角形</span>\n  </footer>\n</main>\n</body>\n</html>"
